Acquiring a drawable via `acquirePresentationDrawable` (which calls `[super nextDrawable]`) can block the calling thread if all drawables in the `CAMetalLayer` pool are currently in use. During a resize, there can be a mismatch between the in-flight Flutter texture size and the layer's new drawable size.\n\nBy checking if the layer's current `drawableSize` and `pixelFormat` match the texture's properties *before* calling `acquirePresentationDrawable`, we can avoid unnecessarily acquiring (and potentially blocking on) a drawable that we will ultimately discard.

```
  const CGSize layerDrawableSize = _layer.drawableSize;
  const BOOL sizeAndFormatMatch = layerDrawableSize.width == texture.texture.width &&
                                  layerDrawableSize.height == texture.texture.height &&
                                  _layer.pixelFormat == texture.texture.pixelFormat;

  if (sizeAndFormatMatch) {
    id<CAMetalDrawable> presentationDrawable = [_layer acquirePresentationDrawable];
    id<MTLTexture> presentationTexture = presentationDrawable.texture;

    if (presentationTexture != nil) {
      // Copy the IOSurface-backed Flutter result into the drawable owned by this CAMetalLayer.
      // Encoding the copy and presentation on the render command buffer preserves GPU ordering
      // without making the CPU wait.
      id<MTLBlitCommandEncoder> blit = [commandBuffer blitCommandEncoder];
      MTLOrigin origin = MTLOriginMake(0, 0, 0);
      MTLSize size = MTLSizeMake(texture.texture.width, texture.texture.height, 1);
      [blit copyFromTexture:texture.texture
                sourceSlice:0
                sourceLevel:0
               sourceOrigin:origin
                 sourceSize:size
                  toTexture:presentationTexture
           destinationSlice:0
           destinationLevel:0
          destinationOrigin:origin];
      [blit endEncoding];
      // Defer presentation until the command buffer is scheduled so the native
      // drawable can join the Core Animation transaction used by platform views.
      _presentationDrawable = presentationDrawable;
    }
  }
```

